      en: ["Originally built by the Swedes in 1653 as Carolusburg.", "It was the headquarters of the British administration from 1664.", "The dungeons could hold roughly 1,500 enslaved people at once.", "Designated as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1979.", "It houses the West African Historical Museum since 1974.", "President Barack Obama visited the site during his 2009 trip."],
